      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I'm Prashanth Durgam, an aspiring software engineer\nwith a background in Computer Science and\nEngineering. I enjoy building scalable full-stack\napplications and exploring how AI can be integrated\ninto practical software systems.",
