      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I'm Prashanth Durgam, an aspiring software engineer with a background in Computer Science and Engineering. I enjoy building scalable full-stack applications and exploring how AI can be integrated into practical software systems.",
